On your comment filter question: Comments are NOT filtered from doc.tokens — they're stored from the raw tokenizer output before the parser's CommentFilter::filter runs. So extract_doc_comment_for_func in hover.rs already has access to them. If doc comment hover isn't working for you, double check that the comment is on the line immediately above the ~ line with no blank line between them.